msgstr "Umphathi Welogi Yokucwaninga"

#: setup.php
msgid "Technical Support"
msgstr "Ukusekelwa Kwezobuchwepheshe"

#: setup.php
msgid "View Audit Log"
msgstr "Buka Ilogi Yokuhlola"

#: setup.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to view change activity on the Cacti server.  Administrators can also export the audit log for analysis purposes."
msgstr "Ivumela Abaphathi ukuthi babuke umsebenzi wezinguquko kuseva ye-Cacti.  Abaphathi bangakwazi futhi ukuthumela ngaphandle ilogi yokucwaninga ngezinhloso zokuhlaziya."

#: setup.php
